{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-9b7e9f445335c79308e149fa7663b45019526ecced7a4966","family_id":"KR:007467","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Rules on Measurement of Ship Tonnage","title_original":"선박톤수의 측정에 관한 규칙","kind":"해양수산부령","source_version":"233591","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=233591","source_sha256":"86d0a65be806f7367d84c8e503c399209a614e2ef6ffb877cf8a6bbdcaf5f140","body_sha256":"63ee7ef35446ac14df7839e3f318e71e2bab61b75f0e8eac4443ef982905cb31","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 9 (Calculation of International Gross Tonnage)\n(1) International gross tonnage shall be the value obtained by multiplying the total volume of enclosed spaces less the total volume of excluded spaces (V) by the coefficient calculated by the following formula, expressed in measurement tons:\n\n0.2 + 0.02 × log₁₀V\n\n(2) The excluded spaces referred to in paragraph (1) are spaces whose openings meet the criteria in the items of Article 32 in terms of their location, configuration or size.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.title.json","sha256":"c897b8af8593e31fdc2f6cb0caef7bbf94c13d2953aacc9e1b32bc312a7cd2e9"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-9.json","sha256":"a3906ab80ce5884fea24142014236fa6dd071dfc0ac4da1641d1c4cf502a6399"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률